# Data dictionary UI (CURRENT → TARGET)

- Legacy markup binds labels/validators via `Tablename` + `Fieldname` → `Session("dc")` from `dbo.DataDictionary` (see `docs/architecture/data-dictionary-controls.md`).
- Designer English text in ascx is fallback only; dictionary caption is authoritative.
- Language is selected at `CommonLib.LoadDC` (`GetOrgDataDictionary` / fallback SELECT mapping Caption|ACaption|FCaption into `Caption`).
- TARGET: do not port HITSCulturedControl / HITSControlLibrary inheritance. Prefer a metadata API + Razor helpers using the same `(TableName, FieldName)` keys.
- Do not invent parallel EN/AR resource files by hand for a slice — export or call DataDictionary for that module's keys.
